      "id": "6b13f86211654f89",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -43180,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**≈ \\$552 000（约 \\$0.55 million）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4df1338aba54417",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -43180,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**≤ 1 年**"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e19517477e548c8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -43180,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**① 10-day VaR**"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdff697e6f144972",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -43070,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**① 资本分层（Tier 1 / Tier 2）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a5e920f2dfa45c2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -43070,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**② Capital core**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c6ef49eea784e06",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -43070,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**② 风险加权资产 RWA 的四档权重**"
    },
    {
      "id": "90ed6a7c3cae4df6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -42960,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**③ SRC**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fb9237f780904316",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -42960,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**③ 计算 Cooke Ratio 并判断合规性**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9665ad36522a4dcd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -42960,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**⬇️ 第一层：监管演进时间线（**"
    },
    {
      "id": "67198f18c5e54298",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -42850,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**⬇️ 第三层：三大风险的**"
    },
    {
      "id": "979731822e194862",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -42850,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**⬇️ 第二层：两本账的“分水岭”**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d7e3c8d737554328",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -42850,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**。当有新交易加入时，可直接利用已保存的市场情景，对每条模拟路径在对应时间节点为新交易重新定价，得到新交易在各情景下各时点的价值 。然后将此**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f0dcda3700ce498c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -42740,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**。触发条件通常与发行银行资本充足水平挂钩，如一级资本比率跌破预定阈值**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0d3ace8967424c8c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -42740,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**。转换后债券本金按固定转换比率换算为普通股。其关键因素是**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7e956ea42074f26",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -42740,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**《多德–弗兰克法案》**"
    },
    {
      "id": "99739dd8fa294951",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -42630,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一、信用风险 vs. 信贷风险 vs. 交易对手风险 (19 · 1 · 1)**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a16777ae93ef437a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -42630,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一、基本Black-Scholes欧式看涨期权定价公式**"
    },
    {
      "id": "39dad1c3fcee4407",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -42630,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一句话归纳**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3866ad013784635",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -42520,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一年**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a8a59679763e4d35",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -42520,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一致性（Coherence）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d4bf3392acd34f8f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -42520,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一致性：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b94ba6a11b540b0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -42410,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一致风险度量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a47f3c8370bb40cd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -42410,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一般三元正态相关结构（协方差矩阵）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef9e17f9f3be4dbc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -42410,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一行公式**"
    },
    {
      "id": "28cb35e4f66e47df",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -42300,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一行记忆**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c73c58a4b5284871",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -42300,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**三、CDS–债券价差方向 & 抽样表 (19 · 2 同页)**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9db8b9517ecf489d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -42300,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**三、推广的Black-Scholes公式**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3ec1429a21044a3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -42190,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**上升而下降**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f4d5eed52504e10",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -42190,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**上尾相关**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c520d0f9c1c546ef",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -42190,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**下降约 $23.82\\%$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "daecb1d2cad44525",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -42080,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**下降约 $25.73\\%$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "84a5007b9eec44f4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -42080,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**下限期权（Floor）和利率期权债券**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bbe94b038ddc4c81",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -42080,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不付股息股票欧式期权**"
    },
    {
      "id": "19c8f1a0981246ae",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -41970,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不保证满足次可加性**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7a04e5f518f4607",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -41970,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不关心独立风险/极端风险**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba7806307b5b4791",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -41970,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不关注VaR之外的损失（尾部风险）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "2eaabbd061284efe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -41860,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不反映绝对风险或极端尾部**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7ded9d9f89634c8c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -41860,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不含信用风险**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0761f9a590064ebe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -41860,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不改变真实经济风险**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bea95a4d656344df",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -41750,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不满足**"
    },
    {
      "id": "5cd89f2915a64162",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -41750,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不直接使用**"
    },
    {
      "id": "5be6c76decdb42fb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -41750,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不能反映分布尾部极端损失、不可加**"
    },
    {
      "id": "81af7faa4e41488b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -41640,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不能捕捉尾部和偏度**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0b57b1620f22410a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -41640,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不鼓励全面对冲CVA**"
    },
    {
      "id": "6f96015342cd4ddf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -41640,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**与VaR的结合：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b00bc2713214196",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -41530,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**两资产/多资产矩阵公式**"
    },
    {
      "id": "08ef23f3e5964d16",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -41530,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**严格地对复杂衍生品组合进行全重估**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c39d7f02b97d488b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -41530,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**严格监管**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a947ff745b694578",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -41420,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**中央对手方清算**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a60c310c2ebe4705",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -41420,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**中央对手方清算（CCP）**"
    },
